# trustee-match-normalization: fixtures/ holds real staging exports (trustee PII: names,
# addresses, phones, emails) and a hand-built ground truth derived from them. Never committed —
# local-only, re-created per investigation session.
trustee-match-normalization/fixtures/

# trustee-variation-audit: fixtures/ holds a real trustee-variation collection export and a real
# trustees export (both trustee PII). Never committed — local-only, re-created per audit session.
trustee-variation-audit/fixtures/

# sync-acms-professional-ids-audit: fixtures/ holds a real trustee-professional-ids collection
